{
  "info": {
    "name": "Miria Geek API",
    "description": "Collection da API REST da Miria Geek Store.\n\n**Variáveis da collection:**\n- `baseUrl` — URL base da API (padrão: `http://localhost:8080`)\n- `accessToken` — JWT Bearer token (preenchido após login)\n- `verificationToken` — UUID do token de verificação de e-mail\n\n**Como usar:**\n1. Configure `baseUrl` ou use o valor padrão.\n2. Execute `Register Customer` para criar um usuário.\n3. Copie o `verificationToken` do Kafka UI e execute `Verify Email`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL base da API. Altere para o ambiente desejado."
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT Bearer token. Preenchido após autenticação via Keycloak."
    },
    {
      "key": "verificationToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID do token de verificação de e-mail. Copiar do Kafka UI (tópico identity.user-registered) após o cadastro."
    },
    {
      "key": "resetToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "UUID do token de redefinição de senha. Copiar do e-mail recebido ou do Kafka UI (tópico identity.password-reset-requested)."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Endpoints de autenticação e cadastro de clientes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Customer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Maria Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Senha@123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"Senha@123\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "description": "Cadastra um novo cliente na plataforma.\n\n**Regras de negócio:**\n- `fullName` deve ter entre 3 e 255 caracteres\n- `email` deve ser único\n- `password` deve ter no mínimo 8 caracteres com letras e números\n- `password` e `passwordConfirmation` devem ser iguais\n\n**Resposta de sucesso:** `201 Created`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 - Customer registered",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Maria Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"status\": \"PENDING_VERIFICATION\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-15T19:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Maria Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Senha@123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"Senha@123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "400 - Validation error",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n  \"message\": \"email: Invalid email format\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-15T19:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"email-invalido\",\n  \"password\": \"123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"456\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "409 - Email already exists",
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"EMAIL_CONFLICT\",\n  \"message\": \"Email already registered\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-15T19:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Maria Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Senha@123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"Senha@123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email?token={{verificationToken}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "verify-email"],
              "query": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{verificationToken}}", "description": "UUID do token de verificação recebido por e-mail"}]
            },
            "description": "Verifica o e-mail do cliente e ativa a conta.\n\nCopie o `verificationToken` do Kafka UI (tópico `identity.user-registered`) e cole na variável da collection.\n\n**Respostas:**\n- `200 OK` — conta ativada\n- `404 Not Found` — token inexistente\n- `409 Conflict` — e-mail já verificado\n- `410 Gone` — token expirado (válido por 24h)"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Email verified",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Email verified successfully. Your account is now active.\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email?token={{verificationToken}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "verify-email"], "query": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{verificationToken}}"}]}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "404 - Token not found",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"TOKEN_NOT_FOUND\",\n  \"message\": \"Verification token not found\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-15T19:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email?token=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "verify-email"], "query": [{"key": "token", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"}]}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "409 - Already verified",
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"ALREADY_VERIFIED\",\n  \"message\": \"Email has already been verified\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-15T19:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email?token={{verificationToken}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "verify-email"], "query": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{verificationToken}}"}]}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "410 - Token expired",
              "status": "Gone",
              "code": 410,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"TOKEN_EXPIRED\",\n  \"message\": \"Verification token has expired. Please request a new verification email.\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-15T19:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email?token={{verificationToken}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "verify-email"], "query": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{verificationToken}}"}]}
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend Verification Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/resend-verification",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "resend-verification"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "description": "Reenvia o e-mail de verificação para contas com status `PENDING_VERIFICATION`.\n\n**Segurança:** Sempre retorna `204 No Content`, independentemente de o e-mail existir ou não na base.\n\n**Rate limit:** máximo 3 reenvios por hora por e-mail."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "204 - Sent (or silently ignored)",
              "status": "No Content",
              "code": 204,
              "header": [],
              "body": "",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/resend-verification", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "resend-verification"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userEmail', json.email);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Senha@123\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "description": "Autentica o cliente e retorna os tokens JWT via cookies HttpOnly.\n\n**Cookies retornados:**\n- `access_token` (HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict, 15 min)\n- `refresh_token` (HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict, path `/api/v1/auth/refresh`, 30 dias)\n\n**Regras de bloqueio:** 5 tentativas incorretas → conta bloqueada por 15 minutos.\n\n**Respostas:**\n- `200 OK` — login efetuado\n- `401 Unauthorized` — credenciais inválidas\n- `403 Forbidden` — conta não ativa (e-mail não verificado ou desativada)\n- `423 Locked` — conta bloqueada por excesso de tentativas"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Login successful",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
                {"key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "access_token=<jwt>; Path=/; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=900"},
                {"key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refresh_token=<token>; Path=/api/v1/auth/refresh; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=2592000"}
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"roles\": [\"ROLE_CUSTOMER\"]\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Senha@123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 - Invalid credentials",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"INVALID_CREDENTIALS\",\n  \"message\": \"Invalid email or password\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrong\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "403 - Account not active",
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"ACCOUNT_NOT_ACTIVE\",\n  \"message\": \"Confirme seu e-mail para continuar\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"pending@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Senha@123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "423 - Account locked",
              "status": "Locked",
              "code": 423,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"ACCOUNT_LOCKED\",\n  \"message\": \"Account temporarily locked due to too many failed attempts. Try again in 15 minutes.\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrong\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "description": "Solicita redefinição de senha.\n\n**Segurança:** Sempre retorna `204 No Content`, independentemente de o e-mail existir ou não.\nUm link de redefinição com token UUID é enviado por e-mail.\n\n**Token:** válido por 1 hora, uso único."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "204 - Request received",
              "status": "No Content",
              "code": 204,
              "header": [],
              "body": "",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria.silva@email.com\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NovaSenha@123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"NovaSenha@123\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "description": "Redefine a senha usando o token recebido por e-mail.\n\n**Respostas:**\n- `204 No Content` — senha redefinida, todos os dispositivos deslogados\n- `400 Bad Request` — senhas não coincidem ou violam política\n- `404 Not Found` — token não encontrado\n- `409 Conflict` — token já utilizado\n- `410 Gone` — token expirado"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "204 - Password reset",
              "status": "No Content",
              "code": 204,
              "header": [],
              "body": "",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NovaSenha@123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"NovaSenha@123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "404 - Token not found",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"RESET_TOKEN_NOT_FOUND\",\n  \"message\": \"Password reset token not found\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NovaSenha@123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"NovaSenha@123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "409 - Token already used",
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"RESET_TOKEN_ALREADY_USED\",\n  \"message\": \"Password reset token has already been used\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NovaSenha@123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"NovaSenha@123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "410 - Token expired",
              "status": "Gone",
              "code": 410,
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"RESET_TOKEN_EXPIRED\",\n  \"message\": \"Password reset token has expired. Please request a new one.\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "reset-password"]},
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NovaSenha@123\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"NovaSenha@123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Encerra a sessão atual revogando o refresh token do cookie.\n\n- Lê o cookie `refresh_token` automaticamente\n- Revoga o token no banco de dados\n- Limpa os cookies `access_token` e `refresh_token` (Max-Age=0)\n- Funciona mesmo se o access token já estiver expirado\n\n**Resposta:** `204 No Content`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "204 - Logout successful",
              "status": "No Content",
              "code": 204,
              "header": [
                {"key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "access_token=; Path=/; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=0"},
                {"key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refresh_token=; Path=/api/v1/auth/refresh; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=0"}
              ],
              "body": "",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"]}
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout All Devices",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout-all",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout-all"]
            },
            "description": "Encerra a sessão em **todos os dispositivos** do usuário.\n\n- Identifica o usuário pelo cookie `refresh_token`\n- Revoga todos os refresh tokens ativos desse usuário no banco\n- Limpa os cookies `access_token` e `refresh_token` do dispositivo atual\n\n**Resposta:** `204 No Content`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "204 - All sessions revoked",
              "status": "No Content",
              "code": 204,
              "header": [
                {"key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "access_token=; Path=/; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=0"},
                {"key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refresh_token=; Path=/api/v1/auth/refresh; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=0"}
              ],
              "body": "",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout-all", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout-all"]}
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "Endpoints de usuário autenticado. Requerem cookie `access_token` válido.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get My Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
